# Authored content. Never in the repo: a public repo publishes every future
# day in plaintext, and git history keeps it there. Content lives in the
# database and is served through the date gate in /api/puzzle.
content/
puzzles/
public/puzzles/
.vercel

# Never in a public repo. `vercel env pull` writes the database URL here.
.env*
